<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Permanent cuts fixed mortgage rates.</title>
<headline>Irish Permanent cuts fixed mortgage rates.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish Permanent Plc said it had cut its three-year and five-year fixed mortgage rates by 50 basis points.</p>
</text>
